ur plan? <span class="muted">(required)</span></label><textarea id="missing" maxlength="650" style="min-height:65px" placeholder="The most useful next piece of information would be..." aria-required="true">${esc(draft.missing||'')}</textarea></div>`:''}<div class="field"><label>How confident are you that your <em>immediate disposition</em> is appropriate?</label><div class="confchoices" role="group" aria-label="Management confidence">${[[1,'Very low'],[2,'Low'],[3,'Moderate'],[4,'High'],[5,'Very high']].map(([n,lab])=>`<label class="confchoice"><input type="radio" name="confidence" value="${n}" ${Number(draft.confidence)===n?'checked':''}><strong>${n}</strong></label>`).join('')}</div><p class="minihelp">1 = very low · 2 = low · 3 = moderate · 4 = high · 5 = very high. No default is selected; low confidence is useful information, not a penalty.</p></div><div class="savehint" id="saveStatus" aria-live="polite">Your draft is saved locally when your browser permits it.</div><div id="warning" class="err hide" role="alert"></div><div class="actions"><span class="muted">Committed decisions cannot be edited.</span><button class="primary" id="commit">${step===0?'Commit and see additional information →':'Commit and continue →'}</button></div><div class="disclaimer">Fictional educational scenario. This framework does not replace local emergency and referral protocols.</div>`);
